  "content": "<p>该资源包为<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serious-player-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">严肃玩家动画（Serious Players Animations）</a>&nbsp;</span>模组添加了基础的生活动作！</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KJLfU0ymB0w\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>它添加了以下动作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>待机</li>\n<li>奔跑</li>\n<li>行走</li>\n<li>潜行</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以及它们各自对应的变体动作。</p>\n<p>本资源包旨在与<em>Better Combat</em>模组配合使用，以更好地发挥工具的性能。该资源包的目的是让玩家的动作感觉更棒！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fPierceTH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1340088/description_cb3c4de6-2036-4509-9a7f-33f4457adc1e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"92\"></a></p>",
